  "scope": "Transition-channel construction: both individual regularized private-information capacities vanish for 1/2 <= p <= 1. For every 1/2 <= p < 1, the actual product and full complement have capacity at least 6 ln(2) (1-p)^2 / [49(27+169p)] > 0; the fixed binary measurement attains this information bound. Operational coding/capacity equivalence and the PPT-decoder converse remain outside Lean.",
